  "content": "UNITED STATES\nSECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION\nWashington, D.C. 20549\n\nFORM 10-K\nANNUAL REPORT PURSUANT TO SECTION 13 OR 15(d) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934\n\nFor the fiscal year ended December 31, 2023\n\nMICROSOFT CORP\nTicker Symbol: MSFT\n\nPART I\n\nItem 1. Business\nMICROSOFT CORP is a leading company in its industry sector.\n\nItem 7. Management's Discussion and Analysis\n\nFINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS FOR 2023:\nRevenue: $211,915 million\nOperating Income: $52,978 million  \nNet Income: $72,361 million\nTotal Assets: $411,976 million\n\nCONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME\n(In millions)\n\nYear Ended December 31, 2023\n\nRevenue                 $211,915\nCost of Revenue         $127,149\nGross Profit           $84,766\nOperating Income        $52,978\nNet Income             $72,361\n\nCONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEET\n(In millions)\n\nTotal Assets           $411,976\nTotal Liabilities      $164,790\nStockholders' Equity   $247,185"
